  machine/licenses/GPL-2.0.txt.

  machine/parts/kernal.rom, basic.rom and chargen.rom (OpenROMs, by the
  MEGA65 project): LGPL-3.0-or-later, the texts in machine/licenses/.

machine/LICENSES.md says what is what and where the corresponding source is.
